# A repeated form in a named Structure's body: reached by `call: S D`, it assigns D's place; S itself keeps both written forms.
S:
    t: (int: x 2)
    t: (int: x 5)
end: S
D:
    t: (int: x 1)
end: D
int: code 7
if: D\t\x != 1
    code: 81
---
call: S D
if: code = 7 && D\t\x != 5
    code: 82
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
